382
00:23:45,940 --> 00:23:50,940
Eris would 
look great 
with animal 
ears, too!

383
00:23:45,940 --> 00:23:50,940
Meow!

384
00:23:45,940 --> 00:23:50,940
Woof!

385
00:23:45,940 --> 00:23:50,940
A matching pair!

